{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53817","headline":"句 三 · 白居易","name":"句 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嫌褰锦帐长薰麝，恶卷珠帘晚着钗。\n（见前书卷下《妓女》）（〖1〗川口久雄校注：「私注作『《佳人难出》，田达音』。\n集注作『《古题》，作者不知。\n或云菅三品作』。\n底本『白』字疑误。\n」按：以上三联疑皆非白居易作。\n因其出处甚早，仍附存之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}